* LTC6078 Unity-Gain Voltage Follower, single 5 V supply
* 1 kHz, 100 mV amplitude sine input, 10 k load
*
* ---- Genuine ADI/LT device model (LTspice standard library) ----
.include LTC6078.sub
* (if your install indexes it as a library, use instead:  .lib LTC6078.sub)

* ---- Supplies ----
VCC VCC 0 DC 5
* mid-supply reference not needed: input source carries its own 2.5 V bias

* ---- Input source: 2.5 V DC bias + 100 mV, 1 kHz sine (AC=1 for optional .ac) ----
VIN IN 0 SINE(2.5 0.1 1k 0 0 0) AC 1

* ---- LTC6078 (one half of the dual) wired as unity-gain follower ----
* Pin order: IN+  IN-  V+  V-  OUT
XU1 IN OUT VCC 0 OUT LTC6078

* ---- Load ----
RL OUT 0 10k

* ---- Analysis: transient with SINE source lets gain be measured ----
.tran 0 5m 0 1u

* Optional small-signal check (uncomment ONE analysis at a time)
*.ac dec 100 10 10Meg

* ---- Measurements ----
.meas TRAN vin_pp PP V(IN) FROM 1m TO 5m
.meas TRAN vout_pp PP V(OUT) FROM 1m TO 5m
.meas TRAN gain_db PARAM 20*log10(vout_pp/vin_pp)
.meas TRAN vout_dc AVG V(OUT) FROM 1m TO 5m

.options plotwinsize=0
.end
